# are image-time, so they need a `.#ab-<name>` app from nix/ab-arms.nix;
# coordinator --model/--effort and --review-model/--review-effort work on any
# app. Renaming an arm starts a fresh series; changing its spec under the same
# name gets flagged in the summary.
control  .#
variant  .#ab-variant
# variant-medium  .#ab-variant  --effort medium
